# Regenerable Goa transport codegen (produced by `goa gen`). Only the design
# (design/design.go) and the OpenAPI 3 contract (gen/http/openapi3.*) are the
# committed source of truth; everything else is regenerated on demand and never
# compiled into the cloud binary.
